#. module: qs_image_cropper
#: model:ir.module.module,description:qs_image_cropper.module_meta_information
msgid ""
"CropperJS-based image field widget:\n"
" * Image cropping (free / fixed aspect ratio)\n"
" * Rotate and flip\n"
" * Image preview (zoom, drag, print, download, native share)\n"
" * Optional WebP conversion and multi-size attachment generation\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"基于 CropperJS 的图片字段组件：\n"
" * 图片裁剪（自由比例 / 固定比例）\n"
" * 旋转、翻转\n"
" * 图片预览（缩放、拖动、打印、下载、原生分享）\n"
" * 可选 WebP 转换及多尺寸附件生成\n"
"  "

